===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|en|Milener||native of Milan}}, irregular form of {{m|en|Milan}} + {{m|en|-er}}, from the purchase and importation of women's clothing from Milan.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who is involved in the [[manufacture]], [[design]], or [[sale]] of hats for [[women]].

